        "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to start, challenging to master</strong> – Begin with simple levels that gradually become more intense as the ants grow stronger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 unique towers</strong> – Each with distinct roles to stop the marching swarm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 upgrade tiers per tower</strong> – Unlock new strengths and strategies as your towers evolve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special abilities at Tier 4</strong> – Final upgrades grant unique powers to turn the tide of battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Star-based progression system</strong> – Earn stars by completing levels and use them to upgrade your towers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>24 permanent upgrades</strong> – Customize your strategy with a wide variety of enhancements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The legendary Lemon Totem</strong> – Humanity’s savior, offering extra defense and special upgrades to aid your fight.</p></li></ul>",
